hmd_full.text:
StrictMode. Dev-only, mount → unmount → remount, expose effects not cleaning up right.

Why: React 18 StrictMode simulate future concurrent behavior (mount/unmount/remount cycle) — catch missing/broken cleanup in `useEffect`. Prod build skip this. Single mount there.

Fix: don't disable StrictMode. Write effect so double-run safe:

```js
useEffect(() => {
  const controller = new AbortController();
  fetchData(controller.signal);
  return () => controller.abort(); // cleanup
}, []);
```

Effect no cleanup fn → side effect (subscribe, timer, fetch) run twice, leak/dupe. Add cleanup return matching setup.
